== 1) inline comment after value ==
parsed: {'APEX_ALLOW_SIGNED': '1 # comment'}
value repr: '1 # comment'
Config.allow_signed with '1 # comment' = False
== 2) '#' inside a value (no separator) ==
parsed: {'TOOBIT_API_KEY': 'sk#abc'}
== 3) unbalanced quote in secret accepted? ==
parsed without error: {'TOOBIT_API_KEY': '"unbalanced'} | value repr: '"unbalanced'
== 4) duplicate name — silent replace? ==
parsed: {'APEX_ENV': 'LIVE'} | (last wins, no warning)
== 5) leading '#' full-line comment + export prefix ==
parsed: {'APEX_ENV': 'BACKTEST'}
== 6) value with '=' inside ==
parsed: {'TOOBIT_API_SECRET': 'abc=def='} 'abc=def='
== 7) quoted value with trailing spaces ==
parsed: {'APEX_ENV': ' PAPER '} ' PAPER '
